**/Code Cache/
**/GPUCache/
**/DawnGraphiteCache/
**/DawnWebGPUCache/
**/Shared Dictionary/
**/Session Storage/

# ── Obsidian local workspace state (keep the vault structure, drop user prefs) ──
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Intentionally keep:
#  - .obsidian/community-plugins.json (so collaborators install the same plugins)
#  - .obsidian/app.json (shared app prefs)
#  - all markdown files

